{
 "date": "2026-09-26",
 "what": "Product-level dead air / cut-ins / WER of the Pipecat and LiveKit (room-less) demos against audioforge.serve with the new default diarizer preset low_latency_032 (0.32 s) vs low_latency (1.04 s); policies timeout (1000 ms), hybrid (1000 ms, theta 0.998), hybrid (4000 ms backstop, theta 0.998)",
 "windows": "the 5 AMI dev turn windows of research/INTEGRATION.md section 4 (ES2011b_027, IB4002_119, IS1008b_003, IS1008b_014, TS3004b_064), WAVs/refs reused from scratchpad wf-integ/{pipecat/ami,livekit/audio}; 1.04 s pair = IS1008b_003, ES2011b_027",
 "server": "PYTHONPATH=. .venv/bin/python -m audioforge.serve --asr runs/stage1_heads_pretrained.afm --diar runs/nemo_sortformer_v2.afm --port P --threads 2 --debug-fields [--diar-config low_latency]; one server per session, CPU, 2 threads, 1x real time",
 "hybrid_driver": "the demos' CLIs and adapters whitelist only timeout|head|both; a scratch driver (deadair032/drive.py) called the unmodified run_files/amain with policy 'hybrid' after widening integrations.*.POLICIES and the LiveKit cut_policy property at runtime (no repo code edited)",
 "pads": "Pipecat pad 3.0 s, LiveKit tail 2.5 s (as before); hybrid 4000 ms runs 5.5 s so the backstop can land",
 "definitions": "dead_air_ms = arrival of the first product-level 'user stopped' at or after the true end minus the true end (Pipecat: UserStoppedSpeakingFrame at the mock LLM; LiveKit: STT END_OF_SPEECH in stream mode; agent_commit_ms = AgentSession(turn_detection='stt') user-turn commit); decision_minus_true_end_ms = turn_end.t - true end (load independent); cut_ins = decisions while the primary speaks again within 1 s (Pipecat: after its VAD gate and resume_ms=240; LiveKit: every cutting turn_end, from the Pipecat ref primary_intervals); LiveKit sanity_ok = 1 server session, #END_OF_SPEECH == #cutting turn_end, each END_OF_SPEECH right after a FINAL",
 "sessions": {
  "A": "pc032_* (0.32 s, load 2.8-4.8)",
  "B": "lk032_timeout, lk032_hyb1000 (0.32 s, load 3.0-5.2)",
  "C": "lk032_hyb4000 (0.32 s, load 3.0-5.9)",
  "D": "pc104_*, lk104_* (1.04 s, load 6.0-9.3: server fell behind, RTF 0.72-1.05; dead-air of these rows is load-inflated, decision times are not)",
  "P1": "032p_timeout pipecat+livekit (0.32 s, load 4.4-4.5)",
  "P2": "104p_timeout pipecat+livekit (1.04 s, load 3.7-4.5), run right after P1: the clean paired comparison"
